{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v3","locale":"fr","story":"d15","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.12,"text":"Le zèbre à pois","words":[0.12,0.495,0.945,1.12],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.295,"grin"],[0.595,"smile"],[0.67,"grin"],[0.745,"small"],[0.82,"grin"],[0.97,"open"],[1.145,"small"],[1.22,"o"],[1.295,"smile"],[1.37,"open"],[1.645,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":27.18,"text":"Dans la grande savane, là où l’herbe est dorée et où les acacias font de l’ombre, vivait un troupeau de zèbres. Ils avaient tous de belles rayures noires et blanches. Tous… sauf une. La petite Zita, elle, n’avait pas de rayures. Elle avait des pois ! Des ronds noirs, partout, sur son pelage blanc. Des petits, des moyens et des gros.","words":[0.12,0.445,0.67,1.17,2.395,2.67,2.82,3.395,3.545,4.045,4.145,4.245,4.495,5.095,5.295,5.47,6.62,7.12,7.295,7.77,7.97,9.09,9.42,9.745,10.045,10.22,10.545,10.97,11.345,11.495,12.78,13.33,13.63,14.69,14.98,15.43,16.23,16.63,16.905,17.08,17.255,18.67,18.93,19.13,19.355,20.35,20.35,20.675,20.9,21.425,22.15,22.35,22.525,23.0,24.16,24.525,25.125,25.325,25.85,25.95,26.175],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.27,"grin"],[0.345,"open"],[0.47,"grin"],[0.545,"open"],[0.695,"grin"],[0.82,"smile"],[0.895,"open"],[0.945,"smile"],[1.02,"grin"],[1.295,"open"],[1.42,"small"],[1.495,"smile"],[1.645,"open"],[1.82,"grin"],[2.195,"smile"],[2.545,"open"],[2.695,"o"],[2.845,"grin"],[2.92,"smile"],[3.045,"grin"],[3.245,"small"],[3.42,"grin"],[3.645,"o"],[3.745,"grin"],[3.82,"smile"],[3.895,"grin"],[4.17,"o"],[4.27,"grin"],[4.52,"open"],[4.595,"grin"],[4.695,"open"],[4.795,"grin"],[4.995,"open"],[5.12,"small"],[5.195,"o"],[5.32,"grin"],[5.545,"smile"],[5.62,"o"],[5.745,"smile"],[5.87,"small"],[5.995,"grin"],[6.445,"smile"],[6.645,"small"],[6.72,"grin"],[6.82,"small"],[6.945,"grin"],[7.145,"o"],[7.32,"grin"],[7.47,"o"],[7.57,"small"],[7.695,"o"],[7.795,"grin"],[8.07,"smile"],[8.195,"grin"],[8.32,"small"],[8.47,"grin"],[8.575,"smile"],[9.17,"grin"],[9.445,"open"],[9.52,"small"],